    "colors: hex (6-digit, lowercase) or normalized rgba() -> token name without the --color- prefix.",
    "A string applies to every property; an object picks by property class",
    "(color | background | border), falling back to 'default'. null = leave as is",
    "(a genuine one-off: chart series, category ramps, off-world landing art, status borders with no token).",
    "Colors inside box-shadow/text-shadow are never rewritten; whole shadows map through 'shadows'.",
    "Gray split rule: text grays go to ink or ink-muted by relative luminance, threshold 0.083",
